40
00:02:30,507 --> 00:02:34,651
The first practice check reminds us that No single trait defines life.

41
00:02:34,651 --> 00:02:39,446
Living things share a set of properties together: cells, metabolism, homeostasis,

42
00:02:39,446 --> 00:02:41,696
